,{"className":"font-display text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-[0.02em] text-white mb-5","children":"How to Identify and Reprogram Your Limiting Beliefs"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-body italic text-grey-DEFAULT text-lg leading-relaxed","children":"Your limiting beliefs are not problems to be solved. They are old assumptions running on autopilot. Once you can see them clearly, you can replace them — one SATS session at a time."}]]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 px-6 md:px-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl mx-auto","children":[["$","h2","0",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"What a Limiting Belief Actually Is"}],["$","p","1",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["A limiting belief is not a truth about reality. It is an assumption — formed early, repeated often, emotionally charged enough that the subconscious treats it as fact."]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["\"Money is hard to come by.\" \"I'm not the kind of person who gets that.\" \"Good relationships don't last.\" \"Success like that isn't for people like me.\""]}],["$","p","3",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["These are not observations. They are programs — installed through experience and repetition, now running silently in the background of every decision, every reaction, every interpretation of events."]}],["$","p","4",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["And here is the key insight: ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"these programs can be replaced."}]," They are not carved into you. They are instructions to the subconscious, and the subconscious accepts new instructions when they are delivered correctly."]}],["$","h2","5",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The Identification Process"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Most limiting beliefs operate below conscious awareness. You don't *think* \"I don't deserve love.\" You just find yourself self-sabotaging in relationships without knowing why."]}],["$","p","7",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["To surface them, use what we call the Assumption Lab — a series of scenario-based questions that reveal your *default* response to common triggering situations:"]}],["$","ul","8",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"When something goes wrong, what does your inner voice say first?"}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"When someone else succeeds in an area where you want to succeed, what do you feel?"}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"When you imagine having what you most desire, what objection immediately arises?"}]]}]]}],["$","p","9",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The objection is the belief. The first internal reaction is the program."]}],["$","h2","10",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The Five Core Domains"}],["$","p","11",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Limiting beliefs tend to cluster in five areas:"]}],["$","p","12",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Money:"}]," Scarcity vs. abundance consciousness. Do you assume money flows to you naturally, or that it requires struggle?"]}],["$","p","13",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Love:"}]," Worthiness and trust. Do you assume you are inherently lovable, or that love must be earned and can be lost at any moment?"]}],["$","p","14",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Self-Worth:"}]," Identity. At the deepest level, who do you believe you are? The answer to this shapes everything else."]}],["$","p","15",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Health:"}]," Vitality vs. decline. Do you assume your body is capable of healing and thriving?"]}],["$","p","16",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Purpose:"}]," Significance. Do you assume your presence matters — that your desires are valid and your impact real?"]}],["$","h2","17",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The Replacement Process"}],["$","p","18",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Once you've identified a limiting belief, the process is straightforward — though not easy."]}],["$","p","19",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Step 1: Name it without judgment."}],"\n\"I have a program that says money is scarce for me.\" Not \"I am broken\" — \"I have a program.\""]}],["$","p","20",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Step 2: Find the counter-assumption."}],"\nWhat would a person without this belief assume? \"Money flows to me naturally and consistently.\" Make it specific and first-person."]}],["$","p","21",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Step 3: Deliver it in SATS."}],"\nCreate a brief scene that implies this new assumption is your reality. Enter SATS nightly with this scene for 30+ days."]}],["$","p","22",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Step 4: Use Revision when the old belief triggers."}],"\nWhen the old program fires during the day, use the Revision Journal that evening to neutralize the reaction before it can be reinforced."]}],["$","p","23",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Step 5: Watch for and follow the bridge."}],"\nAs the new assumption takes hold, opportunities and evidence will begin to appear. Take them."]}],["$","h2","24",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The Timeline"}],["$","p","25",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Replacing a deeply embedded limiting belief — one that's been running for 20+ years — doesn't happen overnight. But with consistent SATS practice and daily revision, noticeable shifts typically occur within 30-90 days."]}],["$","p","26",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The first sign is rarely external. It's internal: the old thought arrives, and for the first time, you don't believe it. You notice it as a thought rather than a truth."]}],["$","p","27",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["That gap — between thought and belief — is where your freedom lives."]}],["$","h2","28",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The Assumption Lab"}],["$","p","29",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The Assumption Lab in Vibe Hyr is designed specifically to accelerate this process — surfacing your default assumptions through scenario-based questions, then giving you the tools to replace them with intention. Every scenario you encounter is an opportunity to install a new program."]}],["$","p","30",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Your beliefs built the reality you're living. New beliefs will build a new one."]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"px-6 md:px-14 pb-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl mx-auto","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-black-2 border-2 border-orange-DEFAULT p-8 md:p-12 text-center","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":20,"height":20,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-crown text-orange-DEFAULT mx-auto mb-4","children":[["$","path","1vdc57",{"d":"M11.562 3.266a.5.5 0 0 1 .876 0L15.39 8.87a1 1 0 0 0 1.516.294L21.183 5.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .798.519l-2.834 10.246a1 1 0 0 1-.956.